  titleText: Interview with the janitor - Part 1
  descriptionText: As always, on Friday, before leaving I closed every single room,
    including the laboratories, checking that there was no one left inside. I left
    the keys in the cleaning storage room, I forgot to lock the door. I don't think
    somebody could've gained access to the laboratories and do something so cruel.
    I believe it must have been an accident.
